#. module: project_task_restricted
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:project_task_restricted.view_task_kanban_inherit_project_task_restricted
msgid ""
"<span name=\"restricted\" class=\"badge badge-danger\" attrs=\"{'invisible':"
" [('restricted', '=', False)]}\" "
"groups=\"project_task_restricted.group_restricted_task\">Restricted</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span name=\"restricted\" class=\"badge badge-danger\" attrs=\"{'invisible':"
" [('restricted', '=', False)]}\" "
"groups=\"project_task_restricted.group_restricted_task\">Restricted</span>"

#. module: project_task_restricted
#: code:addons/project_task_restricted/models/mail_message.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "A message of a restricted task can only be answered on that task."
msgstr ""
"Un mensaje de una tarea restringida solo se puede responder en esa tarea."

#. module: project_task_restricted
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:project_task_restricted.field_project_task__restricted
msgid "Hide this task from everyone outside the Restricted tasks group."
msgstr ""
"Oculta esta tarea a todos los que no pertenezcan al grupo Tareas "
"restringidas."

#. module: project_task_restricted
#: code:addons/project_task_restricted/models/project_task.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Leaving the group: %(users)s. When you save, they will be taken off the "
"restricted tasks they are assigned to or follow, with an internal note on "
"each. Tasks affected: %(count)s."
msgstr ""
"Personas que salen del grupo: %(users)s. Al guardar, se las quitará de las "
"tareas restringidas a las que están asignadas o que siguen, con una nota "
"interna en cada una. Tareas afectadas: %(count)s."

#. module: project_task_restricted
#: code:addons/project_task_restricted/models/mail_mail.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Not sent: it is about a restricted task, and none of its recipients is a "
"member of the Restricted tasks group or was addressed on purpose."
msgstr ""
"No se ha enviado: trata de una tarea restringida y ninguno de sus "
"destinatarios es miembro del grupo Tareas restringidas ni ha sido elegido "
"expresamente."

#. module: project_task_restricted
#: code:addons/project_task_restricted/models/project_task.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Only members of the Restricted tasks group can be assigned to the restricted"
" task \"%(task)s\". Not in the group: %(users)s. Remove them from the "
"assignees, or untick Restricted."
msgstr ""
"Solo se pueden asignar miembros del grupo Tareas restringidas a la tarea "
"restringida \"%(task)s\". No están en el grupo: %(users)s. Quítelos de los "
"asignados o desmarque Restricted."

#. module: project_task_restricted
#: code:addons/project_task_restricted/wizards/portal_share.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Only members of the Restricted tasks group can be sent the restricted task "
"\"%(task)s\". Not in the group: %(partners)s. Remove them from the "
"recipients."
msgstr ""
"Solo se puede enviar la tarea restringida \"%(task)s\" a los miembros del "
"grupo Tareas restringidas. No están en el grupo: %(partners)s. Quítelos de "
"los destinatarios."

#. module: project_task_restricted
#: code:addons/project_task_restricted/wizards/mail_wizard_invite.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Only members of the Restricted tasks group can follow the restricted task "
"\"%(task)s\". Not in the group: %(partners)s. Remove them from the "
"recipients."
msgstr ""
"Solo los miembros del grupo Tareas restringidas pueden seguir la tarea "
"restringida \"%(task)s\". No están en el grupo: %(partners)s. Quítelos de "
"los destinatarios."

#. module: project_task_restricted
#: code:addons/project_task_restricted/models/project_task.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Only members of the Restricted tasks group can have activities on restricted"
" tasks. Leaving the group: %(users)s, with activities on %(tasks)s. Assign "
"those activities to a member or mark them as done first."
msgstr ""
"Solo los miembros del grupo Tareas restringidas pueden tener actividades en "
"las tareas restringidas. Personas que salen del grupo: %(users)s, con "
"actividades en %(tasks)s. Antes, asigne esas actividades a un miembro o "
"márquelas como hechas."

#. module: project_task_restricted
#: code:addons/project_task_restricted/models/project_task.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Only members of the Restricted tasks group can have activities on the "
"restricted task \"%(task)s\". Not in the group: %(users)s. Assign those "
"activities to a member, or untick Restricted."
msgstr ""
"Solo los miembros del grupo Tareas restringidas pueden tener actividades en "
"la tarea restringida \"%(task)s\". No están en el grupo: %(users)s. Asigne "
"esas actividades a un miembro o desmarque Restricted."

#. module: project_task_restricted
